 "remarks": "CHARM, UPDATES & LOCATION - 2 LAKE STREET HAS IT ALL! Perfect opportunity for first-time buyers! Tucked away on a quiet cul-de-sac in Norwalk, this charming Cape offers the perfect combination of character, comfort and convenience! From the welcoming front porch to the classic curb appeal, this home makes a wonderful first impression! Step inside and discover beautiful hardwood flooring, an updated kitchen and an updated bathroom that bring modern comfort to this inviting home. The flexible layout offers plenty of possibilities, including an upper-level space that can serve as a home office, guest retreat, hobby room or whatever fits your lifestyle! The bonus family room/dining room off of the kitchen gives buyers a space to create and entertain in! Storage is definitely not an issue in this home with a full walk-out basement and attic! Outside, the level, fenced-in backyard and stone patio are ready for summer barbecues, morning coffee, gardening or simply relaxing in your own outdoor space. Convenient off-street parking adds to the home's everyday appeal. And let's talk LOCATION! Enjoy easy access to Norwalk's shopping, restaurants, parks, golf course, commuting routes and everyday conveniences while enjoying the comfort of a tucked-away neighborhood setting. Whether you're buying your first home, downsizing or looking for a place with character and versatility, 2 Lake Street is ready for its next chapter. All that's missing is YOU",
